# PromQL Query

Paste the following query.

```promql
sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job="auth-service"}[5m]))
```

Click

```
Run Queries
```

Notice that this is the same query used for the Requests/sec Stat panel.

The only difference is the visualization.

---

# Understanding the Query

The query calculates the number of HTTP requests processed each second over the previous five minutes.

```promql
rate(...)
```

calculates the average increase of the cumulative request counter.

```promql
sum(...)
```

combines results across every running Pod.

This produces a single platform-wide request rate.

