# Operational Interpretation

This graph should always be interpreted together with:

```
CPU Usage

↓

Average Response Time

↓

5xx Error Rate
```

Example

```
Traffic ↑

CPU ↑

Latency ↑

Error Rate ↑
```

This sequence strongly suggests that the application is approaching its resource limits.

